      <p class="text-gray-300">TMDHosting has delivered fully managed cPanel/WHM VPS hosting since 2007. Every plan runs on AMD EPYC CPUs with NVMe SSD storage and includes the cPanel license, CloudLinux, daily backups, SSL, WAF, and 24/7/365 human monitoring — all bundled into one flat monthly price. Eight+ global data centers cover the US, EU, Asia-Pacific, Africa, and Australia.</p>
