          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Fully managed with cPanel/WHM + 24/7/365 human support on every tier</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ AMD EPYC CPUs and NVMe SSD storage across all plans (no SSD-fallback tier)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 8+ global data centers (Chicago, London, Amsterdam, Singapore, Sydney, Tokyo, Johannesburg, Mumbai)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Bundled security stack: WAF, Monarx malware scanner, Auto SSL, daily backups</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ CloudLinux + Litespeed (16GB+) for shared hosting performance</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 99.99% uptime guarantee with credited SLA</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Higher starting price ($69/mo) than budget hosts like RackNerd ($1.99) or Hosthatch</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Payment is "paid monthly" — annual discounts rarely publicized</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Single control panel (cPanel/WHM) — no custom ISO, no Plesk option at entry tier</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Owned by Endurance International Group / Newfold Digital — same parent as HostGator, Bluehost</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances (CPU-only compute, unlike Vultr or Linode GPU)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
