    <div class="bg-[#111] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Verdict</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">TMDHosting is the right choice if you want a fully managed Linux VPS with the cPanel convenience, AMD EPYC + NVMe performance, and a real human support team — without building the stack yourself. The all-included model (cPanel, backups, security, SLA) is what you pay the $69/mo entry fee for.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">The trade-off is the $69/mo floor — three times RackNerd's $1.99 entry — and the parent-company corporate background. For pure budget Linux VPS, see our <a href="/vps/racknerd" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">RackNerd review</a> or <a href="/vps/hosthatch" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">HostHatch</a>. For managed cloud without cPanel, see <a href="/vps/cloudways" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">Cloudways</a> or <a href="/vps/liquidweb" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">Liquid Web</a>.</p>
